 ### Numbered Steps
-1.  **Identify Voxel:** Given query position $P=(x,y,z)$, determine the integer voxel indices $(i, j, k)$ such that $i \le x < i+1$, $j \le y < j+1$, $k \le z < k+1$ [S1, S2].
